{"id":"Wde3b97677f3228e381ba34be","zh":"时间-尺度","en":"","name":"时间-尺度","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C6191468cc8350c05b95d","families":[],"definition_zh":"小波分析中共同表示信号时间位置及尺度变化的两个维度。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wde3b97677f3228e381ba34be","text":"时间-尺度","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S11a5052a1522a35434c3","source_id":"P102","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"为实现轨道病害的时-频域分析,通过对轨道不平顺或机车振动能量在时间-尺度域进行网格划分及能量计算,设定合适的能量阈值,可以实现轨道不平顺和列车振动信号最不利突变能量的三维分析。","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sc99570c78ae4bcb54360","source_id":"P102","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"如图8所示,通过对小波时间-尺度域能量的小概率事件处理,忽略了大量未超限的小幅值轨道不平顺,所留下的均为超限严重的不平顺,属于需要立即进行现场查看并处理的轨道病害时-频域信息。","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":6,"page_end":6}]}],"sources":{"P102":{"id":"P102","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,徐伟昌,李晓建,孟宪洪,唐永康","year":"2014","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2014.04.015","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W2ab0b5aeecdab082dd1b0318","name":"time-scale","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W2ab0b5aeecdab082dd1b0318","name":"time-scale","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W2ab0b5aeecdab082dd1b0318","name":"time-scale","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P102","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,徐伟昌,李晓建,孟宪洪,唐永康","year":"2014","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2014.04.015","journ